{"id": "art-institute-accounting-conversion-close", "title": "After an accounting conversion, the Art Institute needed a $650,000 adjustment", "seconds": 41.8, "voice": "tinyvoca:M2", "narrator": "Temporary local narration", "made": "2026-11-28", "key": "8c797f6035bebaec", "words": 127, "beats": [{"scene": "p", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "An accounting system change left an art school unable to access some historical records.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 4.68, "shot": "s0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["Records", "after", "conversion"], "sub": "Historical records unavailable after conversion"}}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "In 2018 audit adjustments reduced net assets by about $650,000.", "t0": 4.8, "t1": 9.67, "shot": "s1", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$650,000", "label": "Historical records unavailable after conversion"}}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "That figure measures an accounting correction.", "t0": 9.79, "t1": 11.76, "shot": "s2", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "conversion", "layout": "table", "heading": "Accounting correction", "context": "FY2018", "rows": [{"label": "Changed balance", "value": "Net assets"}, {"label": "Audit adjustment", "value": "About $650,000"}]}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "There were two separate findings on the financial books.", "t0": 11.98, "t1": 14.46, "shot": "s3", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "preparation", "kicker": "Two financial controls had different outcomes", "text": "Separate financial controls", "mark": "Separate"}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The next audit closed the issue about preparing the statements.", "t0": 14.58, "t1": 17.43, "shot": "s4", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "status", "layout": "table", "heading": "Two FY2018 findings", "context": "San Francisco Art Institute", "rows": [{"label": "Financial statements", "value": "Resolved"}, {"label": "Reconciliation", "value": "Repeated"}]}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "It kept the reconciliation issue open in 2019.", "t0": 17.55, "t1": 20.57, "shot": "s5", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "preparation", "kicker": "Two financial controls had different outcomes", "text": "Reconciliation continued", "mark": "Reconciliation"}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Auditors singled out receivables, fixed assets and deferred rent.", "t0": 20.69, "t1": 24.08, "shot": "s6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "repeat", "kicker": "Receivables, fixed assets and deferred rent", "text": "Underlying accounts", "mark": "Underlying"}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Management said it replaced the director of finance in October 2019.", "t0": 24.2, "t1": 28.08, "shot": "s7", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "repeat", "kicker": "Receivables, fixed assets and deferred rent", "text": "Director of finance", "mark": "Director"}}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "In 2020 the auditors again named the same accounts.", "t0": 28.3, "t1": 30.99, "shot": "s8", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "follow", "layout": "table", "heading": "Accounts repeated in FY2020", "context": "San Francisco Art Institute", "rows": [{"label": "Receivables", "value": "And allowance"}, {"label": "Fixed assets", "value": "Deferred rent"}]}}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The repeated findings do not establish another loss of $650,000.", "t0": 31.11, "t1": 35.67, "shot": "s9", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "follow", "kicker": "Same accounts in the next audit", "text": "Repeat finding", "mark": "Repeat"}}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "A later independent test would show when the control worked.", "t0": 35.79, "t1": 38.56, "shot": "s10", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "follow", "kicker": "Same accounts in the next audit", "text": "Later reconciliation", "mark": "Later"}}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 38.68, "t1": 40.9, "shot": "end", "visual": {"type": "end"}}], "audioStatus": "temporary-local", "audioProvider": "tiny-voca", "format": 6, "chapters": {"p": "Historical records unavailable after conversion", "b": "Two financial controls had different outcomes", "o": "Same accounts in the next audit"}, "look": "newsroom", "hook": "question"}